{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261114/photo/bkn-20261114101047187-1114_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261114102227\"/><p>貨車失控向右翻側。</p><p>荃灣發生交通意外。今日(14日)早上9時37分，一輛貨車沿城門隧道公路往沙田方向行駛，至城門隧道行政大樓對開時失控向右翻側，隧道職員見狀恐有人被困代為報案。救援人員接報到場前，司機已自行爬出，經初步檢查後拒絕送院在場助查意外原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T02:38:20.784167+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T02:10:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T05:13:31.011182+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T02:31:35.124493+00:00","content_hash":"97903d7176c4b5eed80a1feac0328650c2c3820ab5c0260046d9d60eac0f127a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}